 C(3C-SiC) LEIP LAB   EVAL-SEP17 Y. Zhu, J.L. Wormald, A.I. Hawari  44 1451
 REF. 2 (2014)        DIST-FEB18                                    44 1451
----ENDF/B-VIII.0     MATERIAL 44                                   44 1451
-----THERMAL NEUTRON SCATTERING DATA                                44 1451
------ENDF-6 FORMAT                                                 44 1451
                                                                    44 1451
 Temperatures = 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800, 1000, 1200 K          44 1451
                                                                    44 1451
 History                                                            44 1451
 -------                                                            44 1451
                                                                    44 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics    44 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University.  The inelastic scattering     44 1451
 cross section libraries for 3C-SiC were fully developed using      44 1451
 ab-initio and lattice dynamics methods [1].  Phonon properties of  44 1451
 3C-SiC are estimated using ab-initio calculated forces inside the  44 1451
 lattice [2]. Eight temperatures are available in this library.     44 1451
 The LEAPR module from NJOY code system was used to produce File 7  44 1451
 MT = 2, 4 data for SiC as a mixed moderator.  Modifications to     44 1451
 the LEAPR source code were made to calculate the coherent elastic  44 1451
 cross section for 3C-SiC [2,3].  By convention, MAT=44 and ZA=144  44 1451
 are used for C in 3C-SiC.                                          44 1451
                                                                    44 1451
 References                                                         44 1451
 ----------                                                         44 1451
                                                                    44 1451
 1. A.I. Hawari, "Modern Techniques in Inelastic Thermal Neutron    44 1451
    Scattering Analysis," Nuclear Data Sheets 118 (2014) 172.       44 1451
 2. Y. Zhu, "Thermal Neutron Scattering Cross Sections for Silicon  44 1451
    Carbide", MS thesis, North Carolina State University (2014).    44 1451
 3. Y. Zhu, A. Hawari, "Implementation of a Generalized Coherent    44 1451
    Elastic Scattering Formulation for Thermal Neutron Scattering   44 1451
    Analysis", Proceedings of International Conference on Nuclear   44 1451
    Criticality Safety, Charlotte, NC, September 13-17, 2015.       44 1451
